      "utf8": "Now bool is actually the constructor for\nthe boolean type or for the boolean class."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 379266,
    "dDurationMs": 1934,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So when I pass a value here to the pool"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 381200,
    "dDurationMs": 2666,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "function,\nit gives me a new boolean object."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 384100,
    "dDurationMs": 2866,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So you can see here that when I run this\nand I print out just bool,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 386966,
    "dDurationMs": 2134,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which is the function,\nit's actually giving me class."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 389266,
    "dDurationMs": 3067,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So this isn't really a function,\nit's actually a class."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 392333,
    "dDurationMs": 3067,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But when we call it,\nthen we get the constructor of that class."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 395700,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Anyways, I can pass to this\nany value that I want"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 398300,
    "dDurationMs": 2666,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and if this value is a false value, it's\ngoing to give me false."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 400966,
    "dDurationMs": 2334,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If it's a truth,\nyou value like one or something"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 403300,
    "dDurationMs": 2466,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that's just not false,\nthen it's going to give me true."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 405966,
    "dDurationMs": 2867,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So notice here, if I pass like an empty\ndictionary, that's going to be false."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 409100,
    "dDurationMs": 1900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If I pass an empty list,\nthat would have been false."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 411000,
    "dDurationMs": 2933,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In this case, it's true.\nEven a number like negative one."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 413966,
    "dDurationMs": 1934,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is going to be true\nbecause it's not zero."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 415900,
    "dDurationMs": 3233,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The only falsely integer value is zero."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 419700,
    "dDurationMs": 2333,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The next function\nthat I have is known as callable."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 422066,
    "dDurationMs": 2734,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now callable is going to tell you\nif something is callable,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 425000,
    "dDurationMs": 2033,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so that means you can call it\nlike a function."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 427400,
    "dDurationMs": 2866,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So in this case, if I'm saying callable of\nclass, this is going to return."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 430266,
    "dDurationMs": 3300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "True, because I can call the class\nby putting parentheses like this,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 433800,
    "dDurationMs": 3033,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which is going to give me the constructor\nof the class even if it doesn't exist."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 437133,
    "dDurationMs": 1500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Next I have func."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 438633,
    "dDurationMs": 2833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now Func is of course a function,\nso it is callable."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 441500,
    "dDurationMs": 1900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now notice I'm not putting the parentheses\nhere."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 443400,
    "dDurationMs": 3500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'm just writing the actual name\nof the function, which is the object."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 446900,
    "dDurationMs": 2300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'm checking if it's callable or not."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 449200,
    "dDurationMs": 2933,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Next I have function to,\nbut I'm actually calling this function."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 452366,
    "dDurationMs": 1200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now when I call this function,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 453566,
    "dDurationMs": 3034,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it returns a function\nand that function will be callable."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 456600,
    "dDurationMs": 1500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So this will return true."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 458100,
    "dDurationMs": 3400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Next I have func three,\nwhich is a lambda or anonymous function"
