  }, {
    "tStartMs": 573133,
    "dDurationMs": 2133,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You can pass one argument\nwhich is a string,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 575266,
    "dDurationMs": 2034,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and it gives you\nthe complex number for that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 577466,
    "dDurationMs": 1267,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Or you can pass two arguments,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 578733,
    "dDurationMs": 2567,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which I guess are the components\nof the complex number."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 581500,
    "dDurationMs": 2266,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'm not a physics guy,\nso I don't really know how this works."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 583766,
    "dDurationMs": 2567,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But there you go.\nYou can see complex numbers."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 586500,
    "dDurationMs": 2566,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The next function I have for\nyou here is known as Del Adder."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 589066,
    "dDurationMs": 1967,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now this stands for Delete Attribute"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 591033,
    "dDurationMs": 2667,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and it simply deletes the attribute\nfrom an object."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 593966,
    "dDurationMs": 2067,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So what I've done\nhere is set up a custom class."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 596033,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We defined the X attribute\non our instance."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 598800,
    "dDurationMs": 3433,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We say C is equal to my class\nand then I can print out of X."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 602233,
    "dDurationMs": 1667,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This will be valid. I'll get ten."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 603900,
    "dDurationMs": 666,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Then when I do"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 604566,
    "dDurationMs": 3700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "del outer first I pass the object that\nI want to be deleting the attribute from."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 608433,
    "dDurationMs": 2433,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Then I pass the name of the attribute\nas a string."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 610900,
    "dDurationMs": 2033,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Don't try to do something like this\nthat's not going to work."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 612933,
    "dDurationMs": 1633,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You need to pass it as a string."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 614566,
    "dDurationMs": 3100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Then it will actually delete the attribute\nand then you won't be able to access it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 617966,
    "dDurationMs": 2100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So when I do this here, notice\nI get an error on this line"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 620066,
    "dDurationMs": 1734,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because the attribute is now deleted."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 621800,
    "dDurationMs": 1300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now this is completely equivalent"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 623100,
    "dDurationMs": 3300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to doing Del Dot\nand then this is going to be c x."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 626700,
    "dDurationMs": 1933,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It is literally the exact same thing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 628633,
    "dDurationMs": 2367,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The next function that I have for\nyou here is known as DICT."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 631000,
    "dDurationMs": 1633,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now this is going to create a dictionary."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 632633,
    "dDurationMs": 2633,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is actually the constructor\nfor the dictionary class."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 635533,
    "dDurationMs": 1567,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So notice here that I have a list."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 637100,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now this contains key value pairs,\nso I have a and one."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 640700,
    "dDurationMs": 2033,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So this will be my key,\nthis will be my value."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 642900,
    "dDurationMs": 1800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Then I can create a dictionary using this."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 644700,
    "dDurationMs": 2666,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So let's see how this works. Notice\nI get a one and b one."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 647400,
    "dDurationMs": 4200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now let's just add another value here to\nsomething like two one and print this out"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 651600,
    "dDurationMs": 2866,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and notice like an error\nbecause I don't have exactly two elements."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 654833,
    "dDurationMs": 2333,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So this has length three. Two is required."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 657566,
    "dDurationMs": 1134,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So there's a few different ways\nthat you can"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 658700,
    "dDurationMs": 2133,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "initialize a dictionary\nusing something like a list."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 661033,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In this case, since we have two elements,\nthis is going to work."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 663433,
    "dDurationMs": 1567,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Even if we change this to a list,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 665966,
    "dDurationMs": 1300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "we'll be able to initialize."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 667266,
    "dDurationMs": 3834,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So actually let's make it mixed type and\nrun this and notice it's the same thing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 671100,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is fine."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 672100,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The next function that I have here\nis known as Dir."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 674100,
    "dDurationMs": 1966,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now I think Dir stands for directory"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 676066,
    "dDurationMs": 2100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and this is going to give you\nall of the different members"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 678166,
    "dDurationMs": 4034,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that are available on a specific package\nor a class or whatever you call it on."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 682500,
    "dDurationMs": 2066,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So in this case, I'm\ncalling it on the math package."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 684866,
    "dDurationMs": 2134,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So if I run this, you can see it's\ngoing to give me everything"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 687000,
    "dDurationMs": 2433,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "inside of the math package,\nwhich in this case, I guess"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 689433,
    "dDurationMs": 2267,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is all of the functions\nor methods that you can use."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 691966,
    "dDurationMs": 2334,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, we can also call this on\nsomething like say"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 695366,
    "dDurationMs": 1600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "let's create something like dict."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 696966,
    "dDurationMs": 3134,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So okay, if I call this on dict, it's\ngoing to give me all of the methods."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 700366,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Hopefully that makes sense. That is dir."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 702366,
    "dDurationMs": 2600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The next function I have for\nyou here is known as div mode."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 704966,
    "dDurationMs": 734,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now this is kind of a"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 705700,
    "dDurationMs": 3766,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "combination of your division\nand your modulo or modulus operator."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 709466,
    "dDurationMs": 1734,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So now what this is going to return to you"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 711200,
    "dDurationMs": 3733,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is the whole number of quotient\nas well as the remainder after division."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 714933,
    "dDurationMs": 2133,
    "segs": [ {
