  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1156233,
    "dDurationMs": 2367,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Here you can see these two\nIDs are the same."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1158600,
    "dDurationMs": 3066,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Meanwhile, if I have something like a\nis equal to and then I believe"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1161666,
    "dDurationMs": 4300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "this is a million and I say B is equal to\nand I've done a plus one minus one."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1166200,
    "dDurationMs": 2600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You can see that\nI get a different object now."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1168800,
    "dDurationMs": 1400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Kind of an interesting fact here."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1170200,
    "dDurationMs": 4500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If you do B equals A and you print\nthis out, you're going to get the same ID."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1175000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, the reason you get the same ID is not\nbecause these objects are identical,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1179000,
    "dDurationMs": 3333,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but it's has to do\nwith how Python is managing memory."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1182566,
    "dDurationMs": 2234,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So that's why I had to do this, plus one\nminus one."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1184800,
    "dDurationMs": 1466,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So I get the same value."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1186266,
    "dDurationMs": 2767,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "However, I get a different object\na little bit weird."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1189066,
    "dDurationMs": 2500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Obviously, if I make a change to\na it's not going to affect"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1191600,
    "dDurationMs": 2366,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "B, and if I make a change to B,\nit doesn't affect A."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1194166,
    "dDurationMs": 3234,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "However, to save memory,\nthere's kind of some optimizations"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1197400,
    "dDurationMs": 2866,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "going on where they're actually pointing\nto the same value."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1200466,
    "dDurationMs": 2234,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The next function\nthey have is the input function."
